Package: mil-hwx-compiler
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Open MIL to Apple Neural Engine HWX and ANEC compiler
 mil-hwxc compiles open MIL input to programs for the Apple Neural Engine
 (H13 ANEC, H14 and later HWX), without Apple frameworks, firmware, models or
 a device. It does not install a driver; Aurora's kernel provides it, and
 omarchy-ane-tools runs the programs.
 .
 mil-hwxc uses a private build of libobjc2 and GNUstep Base with the
 Objective-C ARC ABI, installed in /usr/lib/mil-hwx-compiler. It does not
 replace or provide the system's GNUstep libraries.
